$DIR/test.p:14:9: cannot use generic method G[int]{}.With without instantiation
    A generic function or type gets a different number of type arguments than it
    has type parameters. Give one for each, or leave out the trailing ones that
    can be inferred from the arguments.
    (see "Instantiations" in the Plutonium spec, section 11.16)
    (run "pluto explain E0137" for a longer explanation)
